{
  "key": 13661,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_Its50YForChildsTicket",
      "en_US": [
        "Yes, yes.\n",
        "It’s ¥50 for a child’s ticket.\r",
        "Would you like to come in?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_ComeAgain",
      "en_US": "Come again!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_Right50YThankYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Right, ¥50!\n",
        "Thank you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_DontHaveEnoughMoney",
      "en_US": "You don’t have enough money."
    },
    {
      "id": "PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_PleaseEnjoyYourself",
      "en_US": "Please enjoy yourself."
    },
    {
      "id": "PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_DoYouKnowWhatAmberIs",
      "en_US": [
        "You can’t sneak in the back way!\n",
        "Nice try, kid, but no.\r",
        "Oh, whatever!\n",
        "Do you know what Amber is?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_AmberContainsGeneticMatter",
      "en_US": [
        "Amber contains the genetic matter\n",
        "of ancient Pokémon.\r",
        "There’s a Lab somewhere trying to\n",
        "resurrect Pokémon from Amber."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_AmberIsFossilizedSap",
      "en_US": [
        "Amber is actually sap, that gooey\n",
        "stuff that oozes from trees.\r",
        "The ancient sap fossilized over\n",
        "time to become rock-hard Amber."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_ShouldBeGratefulForLongLife",
      "en_US": [
        "I should be grateful for my long\n",
        "life.\r",
        "Never did I think I would get to\n",
        "see the bones of a dragon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_WantYouToGetAmberExamined",
      "en_US": [
        "Ssh! Listen, I need to share a\n",
        "secret with someone.\r",
        "I think that this chunk of Amber\n",
        "contains Pokémon Dna!\r",
        "It would be a shattering scientific\n",
        "breakthrough if Pokémon could be\f",
        "resurrected from it.\r",
        "But, my colleagues just ignore\n",
        "what I have to say.\r",
        "So, I have a favor to ask!\r",
        "I want you to get this examined at\n",
        "a Pokémon Lab somewhere."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_ReceivedOldAmberFromMan",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received the Old Amber\n",
        "from the man."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_GetOldAmberChecked",
      "en_US": [
        "Ssh!\n",
        "Get the Old Amber checked!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_DontHaveSpaceForThis",
      "en_US": "You don’t have space for this."
    },
    {
      "id": "PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_WeHaveTwoFossilsOnExhibit",
      "en_US": [
        "We have two fossils of rare,\n",
        "prehistoric Pokémon on exhibit."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_BeautifulPieceOfAmber",
      "en_US": [
        "There is a beautiful piece of\n",
        "Amber in a clear gold color."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_AerodactylFossil",
      "en_US": [
        "Aerodactyl Fossil\n",
        "A primitive and rare Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_KabutopsFossil",
      "en_US": [
        "Kabutops Fossil\n",
        "A primitive and rare Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonJournal_Text_SpecialFeatureBrock",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon Journal\r",
        "Special Feature: Pewter Gym\n",
        "Leader Brock!\r",
        "Brock rarely laughs, but is said to\n",
        "be unable to stop if he starts."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Text_SeismicTossTeach",
      "en_US": [
        "The secrets of space…\n",
        "The mysteries of earth…\r",
        "There are so many things about\n",
        "which we know so little.\r",
        "But that should spur us to study\n",
        "harder, not toss in the towel.\r",
        "The only thing you should toss…\r",
        "Well, how about Seismic Toss?\n",
        "Should I teach that to a Pokémon?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Text_SeismicTossDeclined",
      "en_US": [
        "Is that so?\n",
        "I’m sure you’ll be back for it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Text_SeismicTossWhichMon",
      "en_US": [
        "Which Pokémon wants to learn\n",
        "Seismic Toss?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Text_SeismicTossTaught",
      "en_US": [
        "I hope you won’t toss in the towel.\n",
        "Keep it up."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_WhatsSpecialAboutMoonStone",
      "en_US": [
        "Moon Stone, huh?\r",
        "What’s so special about it?\n",
        "Looks like an ordinary rock to me."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_BoughtColorTVForMoonLanding",
      "en_US": [
        "July 20, 1969!\r",
        "Humankind first set foot on the\n",
        "moon that day.\r",
        "I bought a color TV just so I\n",
        "could watch that news."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_RunningSpaceExhibitThisMonth",
      "en_US": [
        "This month, we’re running a space\n",
        "exhibit."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_AskedDaddyToCatchPikachu",
      "en_US": [
        "I want a Pikachu!\n",
        "It’s so cute!\r",
        "I asked my daddy to catch me one!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_PikachuSoonIPromise",
      "en_US": "Yeah, a Pikachu soon, I promise!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_SpaceShuttle",
      "en_US": "Space Shuttle"
    },
    {
      "id": "PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_MeteoriteThatFellOnMtMoon",
      "en_US": [
        "A meteorite that fell on Mt. Moon.\n",
        "It is thought to be a Moon Stone."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
